=401-class forensics: final-request msgs counts invisible.\n\nFIX SHAPE (i.ar core, iar-agent-cycle.el):\nIn iar--cycle-terminal-echo-close, after setting :completed and\nbefore returning the :block, find the live request process for the\ncycle buffer in gptel--request-alist and call iar--reqlog-dump on\nit (same pattern as the ABORT advice). Guard: process-live-p.\n\nTESTS (test-agent-cycle.el or a new test):\n- fixture fsm + request-alist entry with a process buffer carrying\n  a canned HTTP response -\u003e close fires -\u003e REQUESTS.log (test\n  capture) carries RESPONSE+PARSE for the final REQ id.\n- close still blocks the echo call (existing tests green).\nEOF\ncat /tmp/fix-plan.md | head -5; echo \"...\"; echo \"=== Check the test file structure for agent-cycle ===\"; ls /root/i.ar/emacs.d/test/ | head -20"}}}]},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-14T13:46:23.71552374Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-14T13:46:23.805524293Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":true,"done_reason":"stop","total_duration":8183623010,"prompt_eval_count":127800,"prompt_eval_cached_count":120960,"eval_count":649}\n(3bdc941f02daaa975acee78c1011f613 . 648)
